    "background_story": "Ariya was a reclusive novelist who spent most of her life pouring her heart and soul into her writing. Despite her talent and dedication, she struggled to find a publisher willing to take a chance on her unique voice. Her manuscript, a sweeping epic of love and loss, was met with rejection letter after rejection letter. Undeterred, Ariya continued to write, driven by a passion that burned within her. She stored her unpublished works in a dusty attic, where they gathered dust and yellowed with age. It wasn't until after her passing that her granddaughter stumbled upon the treasure trove of manuscripts, recognizing the genius that had gone unrecognized in her lifetime. Ariya's unpublished works were finally brought to light, earning her posthumous acclaim as a literary mastermind.",
